#: ../../source/postcss-convert-values_CHANGELOG.md:1
msgid "4.0.0-rc.0"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-convert-values_CHANGELOG.md:3
msgid "Breaking: Drops support for Node 0.12, we now require at least Node 4."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-convert-values_CHANGELOG.md:4
msgid "Breaking: Update PostCSS to 6.0.0."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-convert-values_CHANGELOG.md:5
msgid "Breaking: Removes the deprecated options from version 2.2.0."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-convert-values_CHANGELOG.md:7
msgid "2.6.1"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-convert-values_CHANGELOG.md:9
msgid ""
"Resolves an issue where IE hacks were being removed from `0` values "
"(thanks to @Justineo)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-convert-values_CHANGELOG.md:12
msgid "2.6.0"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-convert-values_CHANGELOG.md:14
msgid ""
"Added clamping of the values for the `shape-image-threshold` property, "
"using the same logic as introduced in version `2.5.0`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-convert-values_CHANGELOG.md:17
msgid "2.5.0"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-convert-values_CHANGELOG.md:19
msgid ""
"Added clamping of the values for the `opacity` property to the `0-1` "
"range. For example, this will convert `opacity: 1.1` to `opacity: 1`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-convert-values_CHANGELOG.md:22
msgid "2.4.1"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-convert-values_CHANGELOG.md:24
msgid ""
"Resolves an issue where the units would be stripped from zero values in "
"custom properties (thanks to @jgerigmeyer)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-convert-values_CHANGELOG.md:27
msgid "2.4.0"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-convert-values_CHANGELOG.md:29
msgid ""
"Added a `precision` option to enable rounding of decimal places for `px` "
"values."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-convert-values_CHANGELOG.md:32
msgid "2.3.6"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-convert-values_CHANGELOG.md:34
msgid ""
"Resolves an issue with the last patch where `height: 0em` was not being "
"converted to `height: 0`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-convert-values_CHANGELOG.md:37
msgid "2.3.5"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-convert-values_CHANGELOG.md:39
msgid ""
"Resolves an issue where certain properties inside `@keyframes` rules "
"would break animation in IE due to the percentage being stripped. Now, "
"the percentage is preserved for these properties."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-convert-values_CHANGELOG.md:43
msgid "2.3.4"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-convert-values_CHANGELOG.md:45
msgid ""
"Does not convert `height:0%` to `height:0` (and the same for `max-"
"height`), as they produce different results."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-convert-values_CHANGELOG.md:48
msgid "2.3.3"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-convert-values_CHANGELOG.md:50
msgid "Updates postcss-value-parser to version 3 (thanks to @TrySound)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-convert-values_CHANGELOG.md:52
msgid "2.3.2"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-convert-values_CHANGELOG.md:54
msgid ""
"Fixed a regression where `0%` in color functions was being transformed to"
" `0` (thanks to @TrySound)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-convert-values_CHANGELOG.md:57
msgid "2.3.1"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-convert-values_CHANGELOG.md:59
msgid "Fixed a behaviour where `0deg` was being converted to `0`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-convert-values_CHANGELOG.md:61
msgid "2.3.0"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-convert-values_CHANGELOG.md:63
msgid "Added an option to convert between `turn` & `deg` (thanks to @TrySound)."
