"inside calc functions (thanks to @marek-saji & @TrySound)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-convert-values_CHANGELOG.md:70
msgid "2.2.0"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-convert-values_CHANGELOG.md:72
msgid ""
"Renames `opts.convertLength` & `opts.convertTime` to `opts.length` & "
"`opts.time`; the old options will now print deprecation warnings (thanks "
"to @TrySound)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-convert-values_CHANGELOG.md:76
msgid "2.1.0"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-convert-values_CHANGELOG.md:78
msgid "Adds options to enable/disable unit conversion for time & length values."
